  "title": "Jazzy Middle Eastern Eggplant Baba Ganoush",
  "description": "A malty, crumbly, quick-fix Middle Eastern dish featuring mustard seeds and beurre-monte, made with ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly ingredients in the form of baba ganoush.",
  "cuisine": "Middle Eastern",
